2|0@UCSD^1440482544#cuet9be:AwkwardToast$:It stands for Problem Solving Assignment. It's a homework assignment you get, and one is due every week except maybe the first one. It's a bit larger, you usually go into the labs to work on it so you can get tutor help if needed, and if they haven't changed it they make you work with a partner. But the ones in 8A aren't very difficult - I don't remember needing to spend more than a few hours on one, and that only because we had made a dumb mistake. Best of luck! 
