1|0@UCSD^1440368644#cud8vqo:gdubrocks$:You don't need any online java courses. The course is for complete beginners and is very very easy. 8A and 8B are all about following instructions and starting PSA's early. If you show up on the first day and ask for a tutor when you know what is going wrong you will have an easy time. I also had a hard time with calc. Computer Science is a different type of math.
