2|0@UCSD^1440314991#cucmnwn:Kimtle$:Unless they're changing it soon 8A is pretty simple as long as you go to lecture and keep up with reading (some people don't **need** to do the reading but as a beginner I think it would be useful). PSAs can be tricky sometimes but it's nothing too insane, just don't do it last minute. Source: took 8A winter '15 and failed because I didn't do any of the above, retaking 8A this year
